{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03669",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 4.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.12,
      "end_seconds": 9.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.66,
      "end_seconds": 15.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "I've been dealing with tender red lumps on my shins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.09,
      "end_seconds": 24.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.58,
      "end_seconds": 28.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Hmm, it's been two days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.96,
      "end_seconds": 33.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.01,
      "end_seconds": 44.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "It usually comes with tiredness. I've also had a dry cough, for three days. About dry cough, I'd say all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.35,
      "end_seconds": 49.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.24,
      "end_seconds": 56.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I mean, just a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.87,
      "end_seconds": 61.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.61,
      "end_seconds": 66.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I've had thin bones, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.25,
      "end_seconds": 72.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.79,
      "end_seconds": 80.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to plasters, but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.5,
      "end_seconds": 84.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.97,
      "end_seconds": 89.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.48,
      "end_seconds": 107.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.51,
      "end_seconds": 114.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "I'm on alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.05,
      "end_seconds": 120.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.21,
      "end_seconds": 141.93,
      "duration_seconds": 20.72,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. No, I share a house with my brother. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.42,
      "end_seconds": 157.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Okay, any fever or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.96,
      "end_seconds": 161.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.86,
      "end_seconds": 167.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Right, right. A few quick ones: night sweats or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.62,
      "end_seconds": 174.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "No night sweats or coughing up blood, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.04,
      "end_seconds": 180.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.89,
      "end_seconds": 184.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.31,
      "end_seconds": 190.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.54,
      "end_seconds": 204.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.84,
      "end_seconds": 237.5,
      "duration_seconds": 14.66,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 14, BMI works out to 24.0. And pulse 74, SpO2 98 percent on room air, height 154 centimetres, weight 57 kilos, BP is 124 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.6,
      "end_seconds": 240.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.2,
      "end_seconds": 243.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.93,
      "end_seconds": 250.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.47,
      "end_seconds": 254.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.15,
      "end_seconds": 276.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "There are tender raised red nodules on both shins and your ankles are puffy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.01,
      "end_seconds": 290.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.43,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, my working impression is possible sarcoidosis. A viral illness is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.83,
      "end_seconds": 327.6,
      "duration_seconds": 18.77,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for possible sarcoidosis. Rest and elevate the legs, and I'm arranging a chest clinic review. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Right, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.5,
      "end_seconds": 329.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}